OL,3,AWhen will Poundland shops close? Five
OL,4,Akey questions answered
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland has collapsed into
OL,7,Fadministration, leaving the jobs of its
OL,8,F11,000 staff in doubt in the run-up to
OL,9,FChristmas.
OL,11,FThe company has appointed consultancy
OL,12,FAlix Partners to oversee a sale of part
OL,13,For all of the discount retailer, with
OL,14,Fquestions remaining about the future of
OL,15,Fthe company.
OL,17,FThis is the question that is most
OL,18,Fdifficult to answer.
OL,20,FPoundland shops will remain open as
OL,21,Fusual for now.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
